This is a template project designed for use with PICSimLab ( https://github.com/lcgamboa/picsimlab ). 

To utilize this template, open the project in MPLABX with the PICSimLab MPLABX Debugger plugin installed 
( https://github.com/lcgamboa/picsimlab_md/releases ).

The source code for programming the PICSimLab can be found in the "Source Files" logic folder of the project. 

With  PICSimLab MPLABX Debugger plugin, the code running on PICSimLab can be programmed(uploaded), and debugged
( https://lcgamboa.github.io/picsimlab_docs/stable/UsewithMPLABX.html ).

Please note: If the board you are using does not have a built-in LED, use the Pin Viewer tool (Tools -> Pin Viewer) to check if the example is working correctly.
